OL,3,GNEWSAPaddleboarder triumphs after
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newly crowned world champion
OL,7,Fpaddleboarder who is recovering from
OL,8,Fbreast cancer has said she hopes to
OL,9,Finspire others.
OL,11,FGinnie Betts, 52, from Ludgvan,
OL,12,FCornwall, was diagnosed with an
OL,13,Faggressive form of breast cancer in
OL,14,FSeptember 2025 and underwent three
OL,15,Foperations, the most recent in
OL,16,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
