OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPaddleboarder triumphs after
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FBetts continued to train despite her
OL,7,Fdiagnosis and went on to compete at the
OL,8,FStand Up Paddling World Championships
OL,9,Fin Italy along with 920 other
OL,10,Fparticipants from across the world. She
OL,11,Fwon two gold medals and a silver in
OL,12,Fmasters events.
OL,14,FBetts said she was "completely stoked"
OL,15,Fwith the achievement and viewed the
OL,16,Fcancer diagnosis as an injury she
OL,17,Fneeded to recover from.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
